# Stern CLI Usage Note

This file is Ansible-managed by the `stern_cli` role.

## What Stern Is

Stern tails logs from multiple Kubernetes pods and multiple containers at the
same time. It follows pods dynamically, color-codes pod and container names,
and accepts either a pod-name regex or a Kubernetes resource query such as
`deployment/nginx`.

